, you’re right, I want it)","columns":49,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"F#m","column":19,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-21","kind":"lyric","text":"You say that we’ll just screw it up in these trying times","columns":57,"beats":6,"changes":[{"symbol":"D","column":4,"beat":0},{"symbol":"E","column":24,"beat":2},{"symbol":"C#m","column":53,"beat":4}]},{"id":"line-22","kind":"lyric","text":"We’re not trying (oh yeah, you’re right, I want it)","columns":51,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"F#m","column":21,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-23","kind":"lyric","text":"So cut the headlights, summer’s a knife","columns":39,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D","column":15,"beat":0},{"symbol":"E","column":32,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-24","kind":"lyric","text":"I’m always waiting for you just to cut to the bone","columns":50,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C#m","column":19,"beat":0},{"symbol":"F#m","column":42,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-25","kind":"lyric","text":"Devils roll the dice (dice), angels roll their eyes (eyes)","columns":58,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D","column":16,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-26","kind":"lyric","text":"And if I bleed, you’ll be the last to know","columns":42,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"E","column":9,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-27","kind":"lyric","text":"Oh it’s new, the shape of your body","columns":35,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"A","column":8,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-28","kind":"lyric","text":"It’s blue, the feeling I’ve got","columns":31,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C#m","column":5,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-29","kind":"lyric","text":"And it’s ooh-ooh ooh whoa-oh","columns":28,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"F#m","column":9,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-30","kind":"lyric","text":"It’s a cruel summer","columns":19,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D","column":7,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-31","kind":"lyric","text":"It’s cool, that’s what I tell ’em","columns":33,"beats":2,"changes":[{"symbol":"A","column":5,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-32","kind":"lyric","text":"No rules, unbreakable he